  "categoryName": "Formación del contrato",
  "motif": "Capacidad de las partes",
  "treatment": "inspect",
  "family": "focus-and-replay",
  "description": "The story's end state: Party A's card (●) in Party B's rack and Party B's card (◆) in Party A's rack, both unfolded with their supplied attributes (generic and fictional), and the strip \"Sequence as supplied (illustrative)\". A lens enlarges the unfolding's station (a real copy of the scene, ≥ 1.6×); its label, the supplied status \"Data complete (as supplied)\", is struck, then turns over in the scene and returns with the supplied alternative \"Capacity pending verification\"; only the dashed pending ring round the indicated card follows — a pending state only. The lens closes onto the identical station; a Δ marks the changed label. No rule on capacity and no legal effect is stated.",
